    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72103.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "Well, the tragedy of this is the people who jumped to conclusion in the first 12 hours or the first eight hours who said something to save their own skin. Now, instead of walking it back, they're saying, well, now I need a third-party investigation to sort all this out and we'll get a report on this. They're not exonerating or walking back what they did at this point.",
