        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Truth should be prioritized over personal protection in public discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Retracting false statements is morally necessary after new evidence emerges.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Third-party investigations are more trustworthy than self-reported accounts.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures have a moral obligation to admit mistakes publicly.",
